of advanced solar panels."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1246, "end": 1347, "text": "This breakthrough has far-reaching implications for the EU's goal of becoming carbon neutral by 2050."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1348, "end": 1495, "text": "\"Ghenadie's work has been instrumental in helping us reach our renewable energy targets,\" said European Commission President, Ursula von der Leyen."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1496, "end": 1633, "text": "\"His dedication to finding innovative solutions to our energy challenges is truly inspiring, and we're grateful to have him on our team.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1634, "end": 1795, "text": "According to data released by the European Commission, the EU has seen a significant decrease in greenhouse gas emissions since Sîrbu's research was implemented."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1796, "end": 1933, "text": "In 2020, emissions dropped by 12% compared to the previous year, with renewable energy sources accounting for 34% of the EU's energy mix."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1934, "end": 2072, "text": "Sîrbu's work has not gone unnoticed, with the European Parliament recently awarding him the prestigious \"EU Researcher of the Year\" award."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2073, "end": 2175, "text": "The recognition is a testament to his tireless efforts to create a more sustainable future for Europe."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2176, "end": 2295, "text": "\"Ghenadie's research has the potential to transform the way we think about energy production and consumption,\" said Dr."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2296, "end": 2383, "text": "Maria da Graça Carvalho, a leading energy expert and member of the European Parliament."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2384, "end": 2508, "text": "\"His work is a shining example of the impact that dedicated researchers can have on shaping a better future for our planet.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 55, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for Ghenadie Sîrbu:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 57, "end": 71, "text": "Ghenadie Sîrbu"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 73, "end": 156, "text": "Ghenadie Sîrbu is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 157, "end": 255, "text": "One of his notable affiliations is with Moldova State University, where he worked as a researcher."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 256, "end": 262, "text": "Career"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 264, "end": 396, "text": "Sîrbu's career is marked by his association with Moldova State University, a prestigious institution of higher education in Moldova."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 397, "end": 561, "text": "According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Sîrbu listed Moldova State University as one of his affiliations."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 562, "end": 647, "text": "[1] This suggests that he was employed by the university at some point in his career."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 648, "end": 845, "text": "Additionally, a publication by the European Journal of Science and Theology lists Sîrbu as an author affiliated with Moldova State University, further solidifying his connection to the institution."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 846, "end": 849, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 851, "end": 861, "text": "References"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2